ARM64 host-tool replacements in this directory (aapt2/aapt/aidl/dexdump/
split-select/zipalign) and /usr/local/bin/{adb,fastboot}:
  source:   https://github.com/lzhiyong/android-sdk-tools
  release:  @UPSTREAM@ (android-sdk-tools-static-aarch64.zip)
  sha256:   @SHA@
  type:     aarch64 static executables (no libc dependency)
Official Google build-tools for Linux ship x86_64 host binaries only; these
community statics replace the native tools. Java parts (d8/R8, apksigner,
lib/*.jar) and android.jar remain OFFICIAL Google artifacts. Known limits:
community build, not built/signed by Google; host-tool version skew accepted
(format-stable); cross-check APK output against CI builds.
